WEBVTT

00:09:28.355 --> 00:09:30.649
and a chance to help build it.

00:09:30.649 --> 00:09:34.069
I know that every 10th of a degree
of warming we prevent,

00:09:34.069 --> 00:09:37.156
every centimeter
of sea level rise we avoid,

00:09:37.156 --> 00:09:42.077
every bit of nature
we protect and restore matters

00:09:42.494 --> 00:09:44.747
I know that our actions add up.

00:09:45.456 --> 00:09:46.665
This?

00:09:46.999 --> 00:09:49.043
This is an invitation.

00:09:49.835 --> 00:09:51.837
Find your role if you haven’t already,

00:09:51.879 --> 00:09:54.256
encourage others to find theirs.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.092
Averting climate catastrophe:

00:09:57.134 --> 00:10:00.846
this is the work of our lifetimes.